## Supabase API Patterns

- Client: [db/supabase.js](mdc:src/db/supabase.js)
- Table names: [constants/db.js](mdc:src/constants/db.js)
- Response shaping: [utils/db.js](mdc:src/utils/db.js) `handleResponse`
- Transformers map snake_case ↔ camelCase in [utils/transformers](mdc:src/utils/transformers/), e.g. [tasks.js](mdc:src/utils/transformers/tasks.js)

### API Conventions

- Validate `userId` on mutating calls; return `{ error: "User authentication required" }` if missing.
- Transform payloads to DB shape via transformers before insert/update.
- Post-process responses via `handleResponse`, then transform back to camelCase.
- Use explicit `.select()` after inserts/updates when you need returned rows.
